{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Deployment Script Review",
  "description": "Reviews deployment scripts for completeness and consistency with project standards",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "deployment/*.sh",
      "deployment/**/*.sh",
      "deployment/*.yaml",
      "deployment/*.yml",
      "deployment/templates/*.yaml"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Review the changed deployment file for:\n\n1. **Stack Dependencies**: Verify deployment order matches:\n   - Base infrastructure first\n   - Inventory/Staffing tables second\n   - AgentCore agent third\n   - Chat endpoints fourth\n   - Frontend last\n\n2. **CloudFormation Standards**:\n   - Stack names follow pattern: restaurant-agent-*-prod\n   - Region is us-east-1\n   - Capabilities include CAPABILITY_IAM and CAPABILITY_NAMED_IAM\n   - Uses --no-fail-on-empty-changeset flag\n\n3. **AgentCore CLI**:\n   - Uses correct entrypoint (agent.py)\n   - Agent name is restaurant_agent\n   - Runtime is PYTHON_3_11\n   - Memory is disabled (--disable-memory)\n\n4. **IAM Permissions**:\n   - DynamoDB access for restaurant-agent-* tables\n   - Bedrock InvokeModel permissions\n   - Least privilege principle\n\n5. **Error Handling**:\n   - Uses set -e for fail-fast\n   - Proper error messages\n   - Cleanup on failure if applicable\n\nHighlight any issues and suggest fixes."
  }
}
